        <mxCell id="Y_guw_4IluHyYSohix8G-161" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Reporting / Dashboards&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reporting and Dashboards are out of scope of generic solution.&lt;br&gt;Actual solution may contain ETL/ELT process, data marts and other data staging technics, but that is all excluded in this diagram&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=default;dashed=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
