        <mxCell id="SY4ZMVpTKN2kTq89RxM0-23" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Content Delivery Network&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;In order to draw complete architecture, we need CDN for the means to host static resources (SPA, images and other static content) and also to proxy/cache requests from API gateway.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=default;dashed=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
