        <mxCell id="t-olgNRX4INOk8NRnw1V-26" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;API Gateway and BFF&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;API Gateway and Backend for Frontend usually work together to orchestrate read/write operations that are coming from the user and abstract away internal communications and aggregations. They may also be represented as single Service and not two distinct services.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=default;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
